</person-group><article-title>The genetics and biochemistry of floral pigments</article-title><source>Annu. Rev. Plant Biol.</source><year>2006</year><volume>57</volume><fpage>761</fpage><lpage>780</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1146/annurev.arplant.57.032905.105248</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16669781</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="B4-molecules-26-07000"><label>4.</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author">
