</person-group><article-title>Effects of various temperatures and pH values on the extraction yield of phenolics from litchi fruit pericarp tissue and the antioxidant activity of the extracted anthocyanins</article-title><source>Int. J. Mol. Sci.</source><year>2008</year><volume>9</volume><fpage>1333</fpage><lpage>1341</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.3390/ijms9071333</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">19325806</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="pmcid">PMC2635725</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="B30-molecules-26-07000"><label>30.</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author">
